  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nLast week we held our biweekly triage call (https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10156) and I will post the meeting notes there in a bit. The next one is scheduled for March 14, 9am PST. Note that this is 1 week later in an America+Europe friendly time, per #10163 and last week's meeting consensus.\r\n\r\nPeople interested in attending the next call please respond here or reach out privately to me or the spec editors. We will be tagging issues for the next call again using the agenda+ label in all WHATWG repos and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to said issues to join us.",
